                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.3131/128: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Venezuela</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Nicholson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-10-21T17:00:00-04:30">October 21, 1937—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>101. Department’s telegram No. 58, October 20, 6 p.m. Simultaneous announcement
                    that negotiations are contemplated will be issued by the Venezuelan Government
                    for publication Tuesday morning October 26.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Nicholson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
